@AlgoTrading.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014

### Dashboard P&L summary (Round 1 vertical slice)
GET {{AlgoTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/pnl-summary
Accept: application/json

### Engine LIVE/OFFLINE status (from Redis heartbeat)
GET {{AlgoTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/engine-status
Accept: application/json

### Trades for today
GET {{AlgoTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/trades
Accept: application/json

### Recent candles
GET {{AlgoTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/marketdata/candles?symbol=NIFTY&interval=1m&limit=200
Accept: application/json
